#
# ABox fixture for the analysis-plan-version competency question. One math:AnalysisPlan
# carrying the single rdf:Property of the statistics surface, math:analysisPlanVersion, which
# pins the exact revision of the pre-specified plan a result followed — the pre-registration
# guard against post-hoc plan drift. The reasoning-free query projects the predicate on the
# plan so the version is carried by a named property rather than a bare annotation literal.
# Unioned onto the merged ontology by gmeow:cqDataFile.
@prefix math: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/math/> .
@prefix ex:   <http://example.org/math/> .

ex:plan a math:AnalysisPlan ;
    math:analysisPlanVersion "2.1" .
